      // be completed. Never rejects: the caller shows a message either way.
      //
      // ⚠️ RESET ONLY AFTER A PREVIOUS SOLVE. Calling turnstile.reset() on a
      // widget that has never executed leaves it in a state where the next
      // execute() yields a token Cloudflare then rejects as
      // `timeout-or-duplicate` - which reads as "your captcha is broken" and
      // sent me looking at token lifetimes for an hour. reset() is for
      // re-arming a spent widget, not for initialising a fresh one.
      function freshToken() {
        return new Promise(function (resolve) {
          if (!window.turnstile || widgetId === null) { resolve(null); return; }

