        // could be measured. The same non-compositing pane also freezes
        // transitions, reports `innerWidth: 0` and refuses screenshots. If a
        // human finds these links landing at the top of the document rather
        // than on the section, THIS is the code to look at first — and the
        // native fragment may be doing the job on its own, in which case this
